  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f974ebb5cd41de74683ff3a0eb9cb068, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lore-en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  language: 0
  title: 
  text: 'In 1996, the air of Harrow Creek was sliced by terror. The "Butcher of Harrow
    Creek" was not a monster of legends, but a real killer, staining the town with
    blood. His macabre calling card: a kitchen knife plunged into the chest of his
    victims.


    Ethan Myers, a young reporter hungry for the truth, plunged headfirst
    into the darkness of the case.


    Then, in a disturbing silence, the Butcher
    vanished. There was no body, there was no confession. The town never knew if
    he died... or merely went into hiding. The shadow of his knife still hangs over
    the city.'
  displayDuration: 30
  isSkippable: 1
